Z||000000||Scott2M4||12-02-1999||07:50 AM||||Is there some place I can go to find a description of all the acronyms used here?  A place that explains their meaning and what they do for the car (maybe even their location on the car)?  All this talk of IACs, ECMs, TBIs, EGRs, DIS, PCV, etc. confuses the hell out of me.  Some of the terms I know, others I don't.  I'm just looking for a complete list.  <B>TIA!</B>||||reg||5
Z||000001||lennyb4||12-02-1999||09:12 AM||||The abbreviations are just that, simple abb. If you have a haynes or other service manual you can basicly fiqure them out. Examples: EGR=Exast gas recirculation valve<BR>ECM=Electronic control module<BR>TBI's=Throttle body injection system<BR>*If you look in the index section of a manual it's a little easier to fiqure them out. Hope this helps you a little.<P>||||reg||12
